      "end_s": 3.3,
      "start_tc": "00:00.30",
      "end_tc": "00:03.30",
      "text": "A low synth drone hums under soft radio static.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "SOUND FX",
      "source_line": 18
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B003",
      "index": 3,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 3.5,
      "end_s": 10.2,
      "start_tc": "00:03.50",
      "end_tc": "00:10.20",
      "text": "Medium shot of Nora at the microphone, headphones on, a mug of coffee going cold.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 22
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B004",
      "index": 4,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 3.8,
      "end_s": 10.0,
      "start_tc": "00:03.80",
      "end_tc": "00:10.00",
      "text": "It's two in the morning, this is Night Line, and the lines are open.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "NORA",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "ON",
        "delivery": [
          "Warm",
          "Unhurried"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "NORA (Warm, Unhurried)",
      "source_line": 26
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B005",
      "index": 5,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 10.2,
      "end_s": 13.2,
      "start_tc": "00:10.20",
      "end_tc": "00:13.20",
      "text": "Through the booth glass, Dev raises a hand and points at line three.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 30
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B006",
      "index": 6,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "ACTION",
      "start_s": 10.5,
      "end_s": 12.3,
      "start_tc": "00:10.50",
      "end_tc": "00:12.30",
      "text": "Dev taps a blinking button on the phone console.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "ACTION",
      "source_line": 34
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B007",
      "index": 7,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 13.2,
      "end_s": 18.7,
      "start_tc": "00:13.20",
      "end_tc": "00:18.70",
      "text": "Close-up on Nora, smiling into the microphone.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 38
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B008",
      "index": 8,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 13.5,
      "end_s": 18.5,
      "start_tc": "00:13.50",
      "end_tc": "00:18.50",
      "text": "Line three, you're on the air. What's keeping you up tonight?",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "NORA",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "ON",
        "delivery": [
          "Warm"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "NORA (Warm)",
      "source_line": 42
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B009",
      "index": 9,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 18.7,
      "end_s": 24.2,
      "start_tc": "00:18.70",
      "end_tc": "00:24.20",
      "text": "Slow push-in on Nora as she listens.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 46
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B010",
      "index": 10,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 19.0,
      "end_s": 24.0,
      "start_tc": "00:19.00",
      "end_tc": "00:24.00",
      "text": "You are, Nora. You've been keeping me up for ten years.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "THE CALLER",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "V.O.",
        "delivery": [
          "Calm",
          "Cold"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "THE CALLER (V.O.) (Calm, Cold)",
      "source_line": 50
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B011",
      "index": 11,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 24.2,
      "end_s": 27.2,
      "start_tc": "00:24.20",
      "end_tc": "00:27.20",
      "text": "Close-up on Nora's hand, frozen above the fader.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 54
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B012",
      "index": 12,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 24.5,
      "end_s": 27.0,
      "start_tc": "00:24.50",
      "end_tc": "00:27.00",
      "text": "I'm sorry, have we met?",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "NORA",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "ON",
        "delivery": [
          "Thrown",
          "Polite"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "NORA (Thrown, Polite)",
      "source_line": 58
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B013",
      "index": 13,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 27.2,
      "end_s": 33.9,
      "start_tc": "00:27.20",
      "end_tc": "00:33.90",
      "text": "Close-up on the phone console, line three glowing.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 62
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B014",
      "index": 14,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 27.5,
      "end_s": 33.7,
      "start_tc": "00:27.50",
      "end_tc": "00:33.70",
      "text": "The night of the flood. The old bridge on Mill Road. You were there.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "THE CALLER",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "V.O.",
        "delivery": [
          "Calm",
          "Precise"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "THE CALLER (V.O.) (Calm, Precise)",
      "source_line": 66
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B015",
      "index": 15,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 33.9,
      "end_s": 37.4,
      "start_tc": "00:33.90",
      "end_tc": "00:37.40",
      "text": "Extreme close-up on Nora's eyes.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 70
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B016",
      "index": 16,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "SOUND_FX",
      "start_s": 34.2,
      "end_s": 37.2,
      "start_tc": "00:34.20",
      "end_tc": "00:37.20",
      "text": "The drone drops to a low, ominous pulse.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "SOUND FX",
      "source_line": 74
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B017",
      "index": 17,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 37.4,
      "end_s": 41.2,
      "start_tc": "00:37.40",
      "end_tc": "00:41.20",
      "text": "Through the glass, Dev leans into the talkback microphone.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 78
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B018",
      "index": 18,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 37.7,
      "end_s": 41.0,
      "start_tc": "00:37.70",
      "end_tc": "00:41.00",
      "text": "Dump the call. Nora, dump it now.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "DEV",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "O.S.",
        "delivery": [
          "Urgent",
          "Whispering"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "DEV (O.S.) (Urgent, Whispering)",
      "source_line": 82
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B019",
      "index": 19,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 41.2,
      "end_s": 46.7,
      "start_tc": "00:41.20",
      "end_tc": "00:46.70",
      "text": "Medium shot of Nora reaching for the cut switch.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 86
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B020",
      "index": 20,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 41.5,
      "end_s": 46.5,
      "start_tc": "00:41.50",
      "end_tc": "00:46.50",
      "text": "Cut me off, and my next call is to the police.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "THE CALLER",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "V.O.",
        "delivery": [
          "Cold",
          "Threatening"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "THE CALLER (V.O.) (Cold, Threatening)",
      "source_line": 90
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B021",
      "index": 21,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 46.7,
      "end_s": 49.7,
      "start_tc": "00:46.70",
      "end_tc": "00:49.70",
      "text": "Close-up on Nora's finger trembling above the switch.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 94
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B022",
      "index": 22,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "ACTION",
      "start_s": 47.0,
      "end_s": 48.8,
      "start_tc": "00:47.00",
      "end_tc": "00:48.80",
      "text": "Nora pulls her hand back from the switch.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "ACTION",
      "source_line": 98
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B023",
      "index": 23,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 49.7,
      "end_s": 53.2,
      "start_tc": "00:49.70",
      "end_tc": "00:53.20",
      "text": "Two-shot through the glass: Nora and Dev staring at each other.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 102
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B024",
      "index": 24,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 50.0,
      "end_s": 52.9,
      "start_tc": "00:50.00",
      "end_tc": "00:52.90",
      "text": "What do you want from me?",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "NORA",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "ON",
        "delivery": [
          "Shaken",
          "Quiet"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "NORA (Shaken, Quiet)",
      "source_line": 106
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B025",
      "index": 25,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 53.2,
      "end_s": 58.7,
      "start_tc": "00:53.20",
      "end_tc": "00:58.70",
      "text": "Close-up on the level meters jumping on the console.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 110
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B026",
      "index": 26,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 53.5,
      "end_s": 58.5,
      "start_tc": "00:53.50",
      "end_tc": "00:58.50",
      "text": "The truth. Live. Tell them who you left on that bridge.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "THE CALLER",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "V.O.",
        "delivery": [
          "Calm",
          "Cold"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "THE CALLER (V.O.) (Calm, Cold)",
      "source_line": 114
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B027",
      "index": 27,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 58.7,
      "end_s": 64.6,
      "start_tc": "00:58.70",
      "end_tc": "01:04.60",
      "text": "Close-up on Nora, her breath catching.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 118
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B028",
      "index": 28,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 59.0,
      "end_s": 64.4,
      "start_tc": "00:59.00",
      "end_tc": "01:04.40",
      "text": "I didn't leave anyone. I was seventeen. I jumped in after her.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "NORA",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "ON",
        "delivery": [
          "Defiant",
          "Shaking"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "NORA (Defiant, Shaking)",
      "source_line": 122
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B029",
      "index": 29,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 64.6,
      "end_s": 68.1,
      "start_tc": "01:04.60",
      "end_tc": "01:08.10",
      "text": "Wide shot of the studio as every phone line on the console starts to blink.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 126
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B030",
      "index": 30,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "SOUND_FX",
      "start_s": 64.9,
      "end_s": 67.9,
      "start_tc": "01:04.90",
      "end_tc": "01:07.90",
      "text": "A chorus of phone lines rings at once.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "SOUND FX",
      "source_line": 130
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B031",
      "index": 31,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 68.1,
      "end_s": 71.9,
      "start_tc": "01:08.10",
      "end_tc": "01:11.90",
      "text": "Through the glass, Dev stares at his screen.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 134
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B032",
      "index": 32,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 68.4,
      "end_s": 71.7,
      "start_tc": "01:08.40",
      "end_tc": "01:11.70",
      "text": "Nora, the switchboard's full. Everyone is listening.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "DEV",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "O.S.",
        "delivery": [
          "Stunned"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "DEV (O.S.) (Stunned)",
      "source_line": 138
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B033",
      "index": 33,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 71.9,
      "end_s": 75.7,
      "start_tc": "01:11.90",
      "end_tc": "01:15.70",
      "text": "Close-up on Nora.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 142
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B034",
      "index": 34,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 72.2,
      "end_s": 75.5,
      "start_tc": "01:12.20",
      "end_tc": "01:15.50",
      "text": "Good. Because I'm not calling from home.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "THE CALLER",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "V.O.",
        "delivery": [
          "Soft",
          "Menacing"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "THE CALLER (V.O.) (Soft, Menacing)",
      "source_line": 146
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B035",
      "index": 35,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 75.7,
      "end_s": 79.7,
      "start_tc": "01:15.70",
      "end_tc": "01:19.70",
      "text": "Slow push-in on the studio door behind Nora; its small window is dark.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 150
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B036",
      "index": 36,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "DIALOGUE",
      "start_s": 76.0,
      "end_s": 78.5,
      "start_tc": "01:16.00",
      "end_tc": "01:18.50",
      "text": "I'm in the building, Nora.",
      "speaker": {
        "label": "THE CALLER",
        "character_id": null,
        "alias_hint": null,
        "voice": "V.O.",
        "delivery": [
          "Whispering"
        ]
      },
      "raw_label": "THE CALLER (V.O.) (Whispering)",
      "source_line": 154
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B037",
      "index": 37,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "CAMERA",
      "start_s": 79.7,
      "end_s": 86.0,
      "start_tc": "01:19.70",
      "end_tc": "01:26.00",
      "text": "Wide shot of the corridor beyond the door as its lights go out one by one.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "CAMERA",
      "source_line": 158
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B038",
      "index": 38,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "ACTION",
      "start_s": 80.0,
      "end_s": 82.5,
      "start_tc": "01:20.00",
      "end_tc": "01:22.50",
      "text": "The corridor lights go out one by one.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "ACTION",
      "source_line": 162
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B039",
      "index": 39,
      "scene_id": "E001-S01",
      "kind": "SOUND_FX",
      "start_s": 82.8,
      "end_s": 85.8,
      "start_tc": "01:22.80",
      "end_tc": "01:25.80",
      "text": "A door buzzer sounds downstairs, and a hard cliffhanger sting cuts the hum dead.",
      "speaker": null,
      "raw_label": "SOUND FX",
      "source_line": 166
    },
    {
      "block_id": "E001-B040",
